WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.003
"Ooh!" Tom moaned.

2
00:00:07.004 --> 00:00:09.722
"My belly is so full.

3
00:00:09.723 --> 00:00:13.461
It's full of milk!"

4
00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:17.857
The mouse laughed at Tom.

5
00:00:17.858 --> 00:00:21.889
"There is still milk on the floor," she said.

6
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:34.145
"Keep drinking, Tom!"

7
00:00:34.146 --> 00:00:43.218
Just then the farmer's wife came back.

8
00:00:43.219 --> 00:00:47.577
"Eek!" she yelled. "A mouse!

9
00:00:47.578 --> 00:00:50.265
There's a mouse in the kitchen!"

10
00:00:50.266 --> 00:00:54.123
"Ahh!" The mouse squeaked.

11
00:00:54.124 --> 00:00:59.832
She ran fast to her hole.

12
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.439
Tom ran after the mouse.

13
00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.773
But Tom was too big.

14
00:01:04.774 --> 00:01:06.472
Smash!

15
00:01:06.473 --> 00:01:09.125
Tom bumped his nose on the wall.

16
00:01:09.126 --> 00:01:14.945
"Ouch!" he said.

17
00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:17.325
The farmer's wife clapped.

18
00:01:17.326 --> 00:01:22.414
"Good cat!" she cried.

19
00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:29.772
"You chased that mouse away!"

20
00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:36.988
The farmer's wife went to the pantry.

21
00:01:36.989 --> 00:01:39.221
"Here," she said.

22
00:01:39.222 --> 00:01:43.357
"I have a treat for you."

23
00:01:43.358 --> 00:01:47.339
The farmer's wife held out a dish.

24
00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:51.675
Tom looked at it.

25
00:01:51.676 --> 00:02:01.533
"Ugh," Tom thought. "Milk!"

